        "name": "places/ChIJZ6m8INsBBDQRXNvAIPNMVSk/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xremR6aEhkbnBGVVhGMFZFcEVlQzB4VWxvM2RYYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "我哋叫咗超精緻嘅 5-COURSE TASTING MENU：\n\n▪️ 前菜 Morel Mushroom + Cuttlefish 鮮味十足，個 Sweetcorn 夾埋 Yogurt 嘅配搭好特別、好 refreshing！\n\n▪️ Risotto 加咗 Asparagus 同 Whelk 煙韌有口感，啖啖鮮甜味\n\n▪️ 主菜 Roasted Pigeon 塊皮脆到啪啪聲，肉質超 tender 🕊️ 另一味 Grilled Australian Wagyu Ribeye 直情係入口即溶，牛魔王必點\n\n▪️ 甜品 Chocolate Banana Tiramisu 邪惡得嚟好 balance，食完超滿足\n有美酒佳餚加埋好音樂，生日主角表示超滿意 🥰\n啱晒同閨蜜或者另一半嚟，極力推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "我哋叫咗超精緻嘅 5-COURSE TASTING MENU：\n\n▪️ 前菜 Morel Mushroom + Cuttlefish 鮮味十足，個 Sweetcorn 夾埋 Yogurt 嘅配搭好特別、好 refreshing！\n\n▪️ Risotto 加咗 Asparagus 同 Whelk 煙韌有口感，啖啖鮮甜味\n\n▪️ 主菜 Roasted Pigeon 塊皮脆到啪啪聲，肉質超 tender 🕊️ 另一味 Grilled Australian Wagyu Ribeye 直情係入口即溶，牛魔王必點\n\n▪️ 甜品 Chocolate Banana Tiramisu 邪惡得嚟好 balance，食完超滿足\n有美酒佳餚加埋好音樂，生日主角表示超滿意 🥰\n啱晒同閨蜜或者另一半嚟，極力推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
